  ('zcrm_5797994000003777218', 'Cloverly', 'Cloverly', 'Sameul Alam', 'Jason Rubottom', 'Cloverly provide tools for businesses and organizations to achieve carbon neutrality by connecting online buyers to local, high-quality renewable energy through their Sustainability-as-a-Service platform. Clean-tech startup creating a sustainability-as-a-service platform to make carbon offsets accessible for everyday activities.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 15:17:03', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003777253', 'Bold Metrics', 'Bold Metrics', 'Sameul Alam', 'Daina Burnes', 'Bold Metrics is building a sustainable future by reducing product returns and informing better design practices. The leading fit technology company headquartered in San Francisco, Bold Metrics uses A. I and machine learning technologies to empower apparel brands to reduce returns, boost conversions, and improve sustainability. Their SaaS solutionsprovide a simple, scalable way for brands to predict customer body measurements accurately while connecting customers to better-fitting clothing and generating powerful, actionable insights to supercharge the supply chain and reduce a brand''s environmental footprint.
Used by trusted brands to reduce fit-related returns, from size recommendations that take into consideration a customer''s body shape and fit preference, to enterprise-level solutions that optimize manufacturing from design to distribution, our technology improves the customer experience both in-store and online.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 15:20:39', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
