  ('zcrm_5797994000003777323', 'HyWatts', 'HyWatts', 'Sameul Alam', 'Sam Ruben', 'HyWatts is developing the Power-Plant-in-a-Box, an innovative solution that integrates on-site solar energy production and our breakthrough Hydrogen Energy Conversion System. The technology aims to offer reliable, renewable, and cost-effective power, ideal for applications such as EV charging stations, AI data centers, and Real Estate Developments.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 15:30:32', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
