  ('zcrm_5797994000003777441', 'Verility', 'Verility', 'Sameul Alam', 'Liane Hart', 'Verility is developing fertility products that enable us to address the critical demand for the projected need of more meat protein, resulting in improved food sustainability, by helping livestock producers and breeders accelerate reproductive performance through accurate, simple, and cost-effective analysis of animal semen samples at thepoint-of-care as well as ovulation prediction.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Market Outlook', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 16:15:06', '2026-03-11 13:39:12', '2026-03-11 13:39:12'),
