  ('zcrm_5797994000003777663', 'Equatic.tech', 'Equatic.tech', 'Sameul Alam', 'Xin Chen', 'Equatic uses a seawater electrolysis process that enhances the ocean''s capacity to absorb and store significant quantities of carbon dioxide. The company designs, develops, commissions, co-owns, and co-operates carbon removal facilities globally, which use seawater electrolysis to extract atmospheric CO2.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 17:06:14', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003777698', 'Spero Foods', 'Spero Foods', 'Sameul Alam', 'Destiny Hyatt', 'Spero Foods is a startup disrupting dairy with novel process engineering and food science technology, working to innovate the first mainstream plant-based dairy, because every human deserves healthy food. Spero has been named Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies, NEXTY’s Best Dairy/Meat Alternative, and The Food Network’s SupermarketAwards. Sold nationally in retail and food service, with over 3,500 auth locations like Kroger, Whole Foods, Publix, and Sprouts.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 17:11:19', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003777733', 'The Routing Company', 'The Routing Company', 'Sameul Alam', 'Alex Wallar', 'Founded by MIT researchers and rideshare industry veterans, TRC is a global on-demand vehicle routing and management platform that partners with cities to power the future of public transit. Leveraging proprietary and unrivaled artificial intelligence, TRC delivers routing from multiple points of demand to one vehicle while enabling greatertransport equity, accessibility, cost efficiency, and sustainability. Its leading product, the Pingo™ app, offers on-demand or advance trip requests and can operate in on-demand, flex, fixed, or paratransit mode.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 17:15:59', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003777768', 'ION Clean Energy', 'ION Clean Energy', 'Sameul Alam', 'Buz Brown', 'ION Clean Energy is a technology company focused on the commercialization of solvent and process technology. It specializes in the removal of carbon dioxide (CO2) from large point sources including natural gas and coal-fired power plants. The company was founded in 2008 and headquartered in Colorado, United States.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 17:20:07', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
