  ('zcrm_5797994000003782052', 'VillageSQL', 'VillageSQL', 'Aditya Raj', 'Dominic Preuss', 'Developer of a MySQL platform designed to empower the MySQL community by enabling permissionless innovation. The company''s platform unlocks permissionless innovation through extensions, letting developers build modern capabilities like AI-native features directly inside MySQL, without waiting on a central gatekeeper, enabling users to get a robust extension framework that includes custom data types, custom functions, and custom indexes.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aditya Raj', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-01 08:56:49', '2026-03-01 08:56:49', NULL),
