  ('zcrm_5797994000003782779', 'Auditocity', 'Auditocity', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Gia Wiggins', 'Auditocity is a B2B and Enterprise human resource auditing company providing compliance tools for business customers in the form of an annual subscription-based SaaS. It allows business customers to curate custom human resource compliance and best practice audits for at least 15 different HR competencies. Customers simply answer simple questions onthe platform and receive a findings report that shows what the company is doing right and areas in need of improvement. Lastly, it provides a plan to get the company compliant.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 19:00:07', '2026-03-03 19:00:07', NULL),
