  ('zcrm_5797994000003783202', 'Renerva', 'Renerva', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Lorenzo Soletti', 'Developer of medical device implants intended to offer surgical devices to facilitate nerve repair, recovery, and storage. The company''s implants focus on peripheral treatment to improve function, outcome, and accelerate healing, enabling doctors to help patients accelerate healing and return function following nerve injury.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 16:19:41', '2026-03-06 13:48:45', '2026-03-06 13:48:45'),
