  ('zcrm_5797994000003783314', 'Electroflow Technologies', 'Electroflow Technologies', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Eric McShane Ph.D', 'Developer of electrochemical technology designed to streamline and decarbonize the lithium chemical supply chain. The company''s technology sustainably extracts and refines lithium precursors for battery production and produces cathode-ready lithium from dilute brine resources, enabling clients in the supply chain market to transition to a green economy.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 20:38:13', '2026-03-03 20:38:13', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003783340', 'dimax.cloud', 'dimax.cloud', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Teri Hamlin', 'Developer of a digital business platform intended to enable trusted, localized, on-demand distributed manufacturing with proof of standard. The company''s platform matches creators'' designs with local producers'' capabilities, allows buyers to search and select qualified producers based on criteria such as cost, distance, delivery time, or carbon footprint, and coordinates and certifies production with proof to standard, enabling manufacturers, governments, and consumers to create and access genuine distributed products and shock-proof, lower-carbon supply chains.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'pitch book', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 20:41:01', '2026-03-03 20:41:01', NULL),
