  ('zcrm_5797994000003785200', 'Allied Microbiota', 'Allied Microbiota', 'Sameul Alam', 'Ray Sambrotto', 'Allied Microbiota is developing a family of microbial products and their enzymes to break down harmful organic chemicals.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 18:24:08', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785235', 'ROOMBUS', 'ROOMBUS', 'Sameul Alam', 'Dami Jegede', 'Roombus builds disaster-proof smart houses that can withstand storms, earthquakes, and stop burglars. It is a multi-model business that caters to home buyers, renters, and various hybrid models in-between. Roombus also offers High-Density Energy Storage batteries.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 18:27:01', '2026-03-20 20:46:34', '2026-03-20 20:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785271', 'Jiant', 'Jiant', 'Sameul Alam', 'Larry Haertel', 'Jiant has transparency and sustainability standards. The company offers gluten, sugar substitutes, natural flavors, preservatives, concentrates, and a lot of sugar. The company uses tea, botanicals, and real fruit to create clean-ingredient hard tea, hard kombucha, and cocktail-inspired RTDs.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Not Interested', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 18:31:27', '2026-03-11 07:03:21', '2026-03-11 07:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785306', 'Aadi Space', 'Aadi Space', 'Sameul Alam', 'Jayram Deshpande', 'Aadi Space is a Space Logistics company with focus on commoditization of on-orbit transportation and life extension services.
Our conviction is that in order to achieve true sustainability, the space ecosystem must be a circular economy that allows for the easy reuse of space assets.
Our goal is to build high performing most cost effectivein-orbit mobility solutions for customers across the globe that include affordable Orbital Transfer Vehicles (OTVs) and achieve space defunct assets re-usability.
Our target market is OSAM (On-Orbit Servicing, Assembly and Manufacturing) / ISAM (In-Space Servicing, Assembly and Manufacturing).
We believe that commoditization of on-orbit transportation would be a crucial aspect of OSAM/ISAM market in near future.
Our re-purposed dual-use OTV is capable of capturing space debris/ resident space object(RSOs) and perform de-orbit missions.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Sam Alam', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Fit', 'Sam Alam', '2026-03-01 18:40:23', '2026-03-06 07:40:43', '2026-03-06 07:40:43'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785384', 'CarboVolt Labs', 'CarboVolt Labs', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Shan Zhu', 'Developer of a super capacitive swing adsorption technology designed to capture carbon dioxide using an all-electric process without heat, water, or complex materials. The company offers a carbon capture platform built on biomass-derived carbons, benign electrolytes, rapid cycling, long operational life, and containerized scalability, enabling data centers, cement production, aluminum smelting, and other hard-to-abate industrial sectors to remove carbon dioxide efficiently across point-source capture and direct air capture.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 18:40:34', '2026-03-03 18:40:34', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785410', 'deusXmachina', 'deusXmachina', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Petr Ungar', 'Developer of an intelligent process optimization software designed for industrial robot fleets to reduce energy consumption. The company develops software tools that complement existing vendor hardware and motion optimizations, enabling manufacturers and large-scale industrial operators to decrease operational costs, minimize carbon emissions, and increase the efficiency of manufacturing and logistics operations by enhancing equipment lifespan and increasing overall production line reliability.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 19:40:39', '2026-03-03 19:40:39', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785436', 'K1 Semiconductor', 'K1 Semiconductor', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Connor Horn', 'Developer of a semiconductor wafer-splitting platform technology designed to enable substrate reuse and performance enhancement. The company''s technology allows advanced substrates such as silicon carbide, gallium nitride, lithium niobate, and diamond to be reused multiple times while producing ultra-thin layers for heterogeneous engineered wafers, enabling semiconductor manufacturers to reduce material costs and achieve significant performance gains.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 19:48:29', '2026-03-03 19:48:29', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785462', 'AgileRadioCom', 'AgileRadioCom', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Sisay Arzo', 'Developer of AI-driven software-defined radios and reconfigurable antenna systems designed to provide resilient and adaptable wireless connectivity for mission-critical operations. The company offers integrated sensing, adaptive communication, and real-time AI capabilities, enabling defense, aerospace, and autonomous platforms to maintain reliable and low-latency performance in dynamic environments.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 19:56:25', '2026-03-03 19:56:25', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785488', 'Alkalinth', 'Alkalinth', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Paul Burke', 'Manufacturer of functionalized electrode substrates designed for improving the performance of anode-free lithium metal batteries. The company''s platform transforms standard copper foils into lithiophilic, three-dimensional surfaces using a scalable, low-cost process that enhances lithium plating kinetics, prevents dendrite formation, supports stable solid electrolyte interphase development, reduces volume change during cycling, and maintains compatibility with existing manufacturing workflows, enabling battery manufacturers to produce safer, longer-lasting, and higher-efficiency energy storage systems.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2026-03-03 20:06:39', '2026-03-23 07:21:43', '2026-03-23 07:21:43'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785519', 'Sequestro', 'Sequestro', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Juergen Koller', 'Manufacturer of advanced adsorbent materials intended for water purification purposes. The company uses advanced materials, customer-centric product design, and technical capabilities to remove PFAS from aqueous media, enabling businesses to achieve desired water quality targets for themselves and their customers in a sustainable and cost-effective way.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2026-03-03 20:12:46', '2026-03-05 06:42:59', '2026-03-05 06:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785545', 'WAVR Technologies', 'WAVR Technologies', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Rich Sloan', 'Developer of next-generation atmospheric water harvesting systems designed to produce reliable, practical, and affordable pure water even in the most arid climates. The company offers advanced water capture and purification technology, enabling industries and communities to access a consistent supply of clean water in challenging environments.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2026-03-03 20:20:55', '2026-03-04 10:07:31', '2026-03-04 10:07:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785571', 'Canyon Magnet', 'Canyon Magnet', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Honghai Song', 'Developer of high-temperature superconducting magnets and a subsystem company designed for clean and sustainable energy production. The company''s technology utilizes plasma confinement by magnets, enabling businesses to develop power plants with minimal environmental impact and abundant fuel sources.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 20:26:26', '2026-03-03 20:26:26', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785597', 'Luminous (Machinery (B2B))', 'Luminous (Machinery (B2B))', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Jayming Wong', 'Operator of a robotics company intended to develop embodied AI robotic systems for industrial applications. The company designs, builds and ships robots focused on automating manual labor in industrial settings, particularly within the solar energy sector to streamline the construction, operation and decommissioning of solar farms, enabling users to address labor shortages and accelerate the transition to renewable energy by creating robots that can perform tasks beyond human capabilities.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 20:37:19', '2026-03-03 20:37:19', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785623', 'Pixion Batteries', 'Pixion Batteries', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Vikram Devaraj', 'Operator of a manufacturing company intended to offer electrical equipment to business enterprises. The company offers batteries, cells, material supplying services, tool manufacturers, and dry electronic equipment, enabling clients to enhance their business operations.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Market Outlook', NULL, '2026-03-03 20:43:22', '2026-03-23 16:47:24', '2026-03-23 16:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785662', 'Katalist AI', 'Katalist AI', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Zvonar', 'Developer of a visual content generation tool intended for structured pre-production work. The company''s platform parses user-provided scripts to identify characters, scenes, and activities, applies consistent visual representation across frames, offers control over camera angles, poses, and scene composition, supports multiple visual styles and collaborative editing, and exports assembled storyboards or video sequences, enabling creative teams to prototype narrative material with clarity and accuracy.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 08:20:31', '2026-03-04 08:20:31', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003785693', 'Gullie', 'Gullie', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Yong', 'Developer of an AI-powered Fullstack Relocation Platform designed to simplify and accelerate global employee moves through automation, transparency, and personalized support. The company offers a full-stack relocation infrastructure that automates relocation workflows, integrates voice AI, and ensures compliance across countries, enabling customers to manage end-to-end employee relocations with speed, clarity, and minimal operational burden.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 08:21:33', '2026-03-04 08:21:33', NULL),
