  ('zcrm_5797994000003785794', 'Decover AI', 'Decover AI', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Ravi', 'Developer of a legal platform designed for delivering insights to litigating attorneys for legal teams. The company''s platform specializes in searching in natural language, accelerating drafting emails, breaking down expert reports, generating legal strategies, enabling clients to streamline their e-discovery and legal research with AI to uncover crucial evidence to strengthen their case.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 08:34:57', '2026-03-04 08:34:57', NULL),
