  ('zcrm_5797994000003787012', 'Byga', 'Byga', 'Joseph Martel', 'Alex Davis', 'Byga’s mission is to improve youth sports clubs. Their toolset provides a foundation for running a club as smoothly and efficiently as possible, thereby allowing a club to focus its full attention, and its resources, on their youth. They believe that sports are instrumental in teaching values such as good sportsmanship, teamwork, and hard work.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Joe Martel', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 12:22:06', '2026-03-03 12:22:06', '2026-03-03 12:22:06'),
