  ('zcrm_5797994000003795052', 'Templar Protocol', 'Templar Protocol', 'Jackson Key', 'Royal Fool', 'Developer of a cypher lending platform for Bitcoin and other digital assets, intended to allow anyone to borrow Bitcoin or any asset, without trusting centralized institutions. The company''s platform allows borrowers to access dollar liquidity without compromising privacy, ease of use or incurring a taxable event in Western jurisdictions, enabling users to borrow dollars against their Bitcoin without relying on centralized institutions.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Jackson Key', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-05 06:53:57', '2026-03-05 06:53:57', '2026-03-05 06:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003796017', 'Ivee', 'Ivee', 'Joseph Martel', 'Lydia Miller', 'ivee is a digital health platform that matches patients to clinicians, empowering them to receive in-home care.
Our platform removes the friction of traditional care and allows patients to receive health and wellness services at their location, on their own time. Our mission is to make care more accessible by bringing it in-home.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Joe Martel', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-05 10:15:03', '2026-03-05 10:15:03', '2026-03-05 10:15:03'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003796052', 'Mindstate Design Labs', 'Mindstate Design Labs', 'Joseph Martel', 'Dillion DiNardo', 'Mindstate Design Labs is a clinical-stage AI neuroengineering platform developing novel psychoactive drug classes for psychiatric disease indications. The company''s Osmanthus ensemble of AI models maps the molecular biology of human emotional and cognitive states by integrating the world’s largest datasets of psychoactive pharmacology andsubjective experience. Mindstate''s lead program MSD-001 received FDA and EMA approval for Phase I human trials in 2024.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Joe Martel', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-05 10:35:51', '2026-03-05 10:35:51', '2026-03-05 10:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003797014', 'Myrias Optics', 'Myrias Optics', 'Daniel Carreno', 'John Fijol', 'Developer of meta optics, nanopatterned structures on glass designed for a wide range of advanced optics. The company develops the next generation of meta-optics for augmented reality/virtual reality, consumer electronics, machine vision, advanced robotics, automotive light detection and ranging, defense, and aerospace, enabling industries with advanced optics to touch nearly every aspect of their lives.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-05 05:19:46', '2026-03-05 05:19:46', NULL),
