  ('zcrm_5797994000003797153', 'VenaResources', 'VenaResouces', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Caleb Brown', 'Operator of an RFID-based inventory tracking platform designed to enhance asset visibility across physical operations. The company provides continuous monitoring technology that identifies missing items, accelerates inventory audits, and reduces manual scanning through automated tracking systems, enabling restaurants, warehouses, and retail stores to minimize revenue loss, cut labor costs, and maintain real-time inventory accuracy with significantly lower operational expenditure.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-06 04:43:46', '2026-03-06 04:43:46', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003797179', 'Copprium', 'Copprium', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Brian Bischoff', 'Manufacturer of conductive copper inks intended to be an alternative to traditional silver-based inks used in electronics manufacturing. The company''s ink is formulated with copper nanoparticles that feature better conductivity, solderability, and resistance to corrosion while being adaptable to a range of applications and anti-oxidative, enabling electronics manufacturers to streamline production processes, reduce costs, and improve product performance.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-06 04:47:53', '2026-03-06 04:47:53', NULL),
