  ('zcrm_5797994000003803099', 'VERT', 'VERT', 'Angjelo Terolli', 'MARTIN MATAK', 'VERT is a leader in wearable athletic technology focused on creating a better experience for athletes, coaches and fans. VERT is used in a variety of sports, including basketball, volleyball, running and other health and fitness activities. VERT is used by over 550 collegiate and professional sports programs around the world.
