  ('zcrm_5797994000003806322', 'Breaker19', 'Breaker19', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Rodney Giles', 'Developer of an oilfield third-party logistics platform designed to streamline transportation and delivery operations in the energy sector. The company''s platform offers real-time global positioning system tracking, order updates, and integrated logistics management tools, enabling oil and gas operators and carriers to coordinate dispatch, improve supply chain visibility, reduce delays, and achieve operational cost savings.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 04:36:18', '2026-03-09 04:36:18', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003806348', 'studio 3e8', 'studio 3e8', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Casey Johnson', 'Developer of a desktop metal printing technology designed to make metal additive manufacturing accessible at a small scale. The company offers compact metal printers, simplified workflows, and in-house production capabilities, enabling engineers, designers, research labs, and small manufacturers to produce metal parts quickly and with greater control over prototyping and low-volume fabrication.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 04:41:29', '2026-03-09 04:41:29', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003806374', 'Mobius Energy Storage', 'Mobius Energy Storage', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Mark Buckley', 'Developer of a patented iron slurry flow battery designed to provide sustainable and affordable long-duration energy storage for distributed and utility-scale applications. The company offers a decoupled, safe, and low-cost battery technology based on iron chemistry, enabling renewable energy providers and grid operators to achieve reliable and scalable energy storage.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 04:48:01', '2026-03-09 04:48:01', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003806401', 'Zadar Labs', 'Zadar Labs', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Mohammad Emadi', 'Developer of imaging radar sensors designed to bridge the gap between sensing hardware and perception software. The company''s technology combines flexible, open-access sensors with proprietary signal and data processing techniques and works collaboratively to permit radar performance with resolution and precision, enabling clients to have automated robotics to safely maneuver around humans other robots and static objects in any environment and on any surface.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 05:50:31', '2026-03-09 05:50:31', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003806428', 'Four Growers', 'Four Growers', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Brandon Contino', 'Developer of a robotic harvesting technology designed to provide healthy, affordable, local produce. The company''s technology utilizes customized computer vision algorithms and robot grippers to identify and harvest ripe tomatoes, as well as analyze plant health, enabling greenhouse farmers to expand their operations, reduce production costs and increase yields.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 06:28:31', '2026-03-09 06:28:31', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003806455', 'Pitch Aeronautics', 'Pitch Aeronautics', 'Daniel Carreno', 'David Bennet', 'Manufacturer of industrial drones designed to perform an aerial industrial inspection. The company''s drones are capable of conducting precise, touch-based inspection and maintenance of industrial assets as they leverage a patented propulsion device that provides unparalleled thrust control and maneuverability, enabling clients to eliminate the need for performing dangerous rope-based inspections, carry out precise industrial inspections at a rapid pace, and generate cost savings.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 09:41:23', '2026-03-09 09:41:23', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003807108', 'Wisconsin Battery', 'Wisconsin Battery', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Vari MacNeil', 'Developer of a battery technology intended for the energy storage industry. The company''s platform conducts research, development and manufacturing, focused on clean, renewable energy storage alternatives, enabling clients to focus on industrial batteries for renewable energy storage for automotive, tools and electronic devices.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 17:48:15', '2026-03-10 17:48:15', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003807134', 'Solid State Marine', 'Solid State Marine', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Tom Calef', 'Manufacturer of marine lithium battery systems intended to power boat engines, electronics, and accessories. The company produces drop-in replacement batteries for starting and deep-cycle applications and integrates features such as faster charging, extended cycle life, Bluetooth-enabled monitoring, and maintenance-free operation, enabling recreational and commercial boat owners to upgrade their onboard electrical systems.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:00:45', '2026-03-10 18:00:45', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003807165', 'Green Valley Products', 'Green Valley Products', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Robert Koudelka', 'Manufacturer of a spray polyurethane foam insulation system designed to improve energy efficiency and thermal performance in buildings. The company offers high-performance, durable foam products with strong adhesion and moisture resistance, enabling residential and commercial builders to enhance indoor comfort and reduce energy consumption.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:04:57', '2026-03-10 18:04:57', NULL),
