  ('zcrm_5797994000003807222', 'Falcomm', 'Falcomm', 'Thomas Hoang', 'Edgar Garay', 'Developer of the solid-state power amplifier and fabless integrated circuit intended to provide energy-efficient power and front-end module products for the wireless communication market. The company develops semiconductor products and provides integrated technology that represents a breakthrough in the search for a power amplifier, enabling research organizations and companies to focus on zero-power RF/mm-wave signal processing and multi-functional digital transmitter systems.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Thomas (TJ) Hoang', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:33:00', '2026-03-10 18:33:00', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808016', 'Rowspace', 'Rowspace', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Micheal Manapat', 'Developer of an AI-native research workspace designed to compound investment firms'' proprietary research edge. The company offers a secure, firm-specific knowledge environment differentiated by compliance-aware access controls, granular permissioning, and research-optimized workflows, enabling hedge funds, asset managers, and other institutional investors by helping them find and reuse prior work faster, reduce duplicated analysis, and compound their research edge over time.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 13:49:56', '2026-03-10 04:01:35', '2026-03-10 04:01:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808059', 'Ubyx', 'Ubyx', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Thomas Otendal', 'Developer of a stablecoin clearing system designed to transform stablecoins into digital cash equivalents. The company offers a clearing system that enables financial providers to offer redemption at face value by collecting the full amount from many issuers in multiple currencies through a rulebook agreed upon by all parties, enabling customers to accept and redeem stablecoins as seamlessly as fiat currency into their existing financial services accounts, receiving stablecoins from many issuers, on many blockchains, in many currencies.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 13:57:07', '2026-03-10 04:13:22', '2026-03-10 04:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808094', 'Coinflow', 'Coinflow', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Kerry Frank', 'Developer of the web3 payments infrastructure designed to provide a simpler, more secure, and efficient way for companies to accept traditional payments. The company platform allows companies to implement full payment functionalities and payout their customers by converting cryptocurrency to USD in their traditional bank accounts, enabling clients to move cryptocurrency from self-custody wallets instantly to their accounts using existing real-time payment rails.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 14:09:31', '2026-03-10 04:13:32', '2026-03-10 04:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808130', 'BondCliQ', 'BondCliQ', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Renaud Pelletier', 'Developer of a central market system for US corporate bonds designed to improve institutional trading. The company''s system centralizes pre-trade quotes and formalizes the price formation process alongside tools for historical data visualization and analysis, enabling bond traders to get access to enhanced institutional liquidity.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 14:18:11', '2026-03-10 04:01:21', '2026-03-10 04:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808170', 'Wholesome Crave', 'Wholesome Crave', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Michel Nischan', 'Operator of a plant-based food company intended to create positive change through nutritious, sustainable, and chef-crafted food offerings. The company offers culturally authentic, ready-to-heat soups made from clean, plant-based ingredients, enabling it to meet the needs of large-scale dining facilities while promoting health, sustainability, and equity.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:14:07', '2026-03-08 16:14:07', '2026-03-08 16:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808210', 'Foogly', 'Foogly', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Kevin Speina', 'Operator of a sustainable food marketplace platform intended to prevent surplus produce from going to waste and improve farmer livelihoods. The company''s platform offers farmer auctions for excess produce, organic pet food, fertilizers, baked goods, smoothies, and other upcycling products, enabling environmentally conscious consumers to lower food waste and support regional circular economies.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:17:28', '2026-03-08 16:17:28', '2026-03-08 16:17:28'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808250', 'Global Neighbor', 'Global Neighbor', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Jonathan Jackson', 'Developer of directed energy technology devices designed to eliminate the need for harmful herbicides. The company''s devices use high-intensity light to make weed seeds collected at harvest non-viable, addressing the problem of escape and herbicide-resistant weeds to provide environmentally friendly weed control, enabling homeowners and farmers to manage weeds without harmful herbicides while promoting sustainable agricultural practices.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:21:46', '2026-03-08 16:21:46', '2026-03-08 16:21:46'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808290', 'Cairnspring Mills', 'Cairnspring Mills', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Kevin Morse', 'Operator of a flour mill intended to produce fresh and nutritious grain flour. The company focuses on European-style bread flours with more wheat bran and germ for a deeper flavor, better nutrition, and baking character, enabling neighboring bakers and cooks to get the wholesome staples they need to feed their customers.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:24:30', '2026-03-08 16:24:30', '2026-03-08 16:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808354', 'CleanBay Renewables', 'CleanBay Renewables', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Thomas Spangler', 'Developer of utility-scale bioconversion facilities intends to fully recycle litter waste and produce clean power. The company is focused on the sustainable management of waste through anaerobic digestion and nutrient recovery technologies that produce renewable natural gas and natural as well as controlled-release fertilizers, enabling clients to offset their carbon emissions by reducing air, soil and water pollution.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:29:59', '2026-03-08 16:29:59', '2026-03-08 16:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808394', 'Mozza', 'Mozza', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Adam Tarshis', 'Producer of plant-based cheese intended to provide bovine milk proteins that make dairy without cows. The company''s cheese offers identical characteristics that are included in dairy cheese such as melt, stretch, and taste by making dairy-identical cheese grown in plants that are indistinguishable from cheese that comes from animals, enabling consumers to have an alternative to dairy cheese.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:32:42', '2026-03-08 16:32:42', '2026-03-08 16:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808434', 'Bubble Goods', 'Bubble Goods', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Jessica Young', 'Operator of an online food marketplace intended to provide fresh and clean foods to redefine the food system. The company offers a variety of food products that are made in-house and by independent producers, using a variety of nutrition ingredients, enabling customers to have one shop for vetted health products, curated to fit individual dietary and functional needs.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:35:19', '2026-03-08 16:35:19', '2026-03-08 16:35:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808474', 'Forever Ware', 'Forever Ware', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Natasha Gaffer', 'Manufacturer of reusable takeout containers intended for the safety of people''s health and the planet. The company uses proprietary software to offer reusable food packaging that is made of stainless steel and is eco-friendly, durable and convenient, enabling restaurants and grocery stores to replace single-use packaging with a smart fleet of zero-waste alternatives, so that their customers can borrow and return the containers without throwing the waste in the streams.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:38:23', '2026-03-08 16:38:23', '2026-03-08 16:38:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003808514', 'Terrantic', 'Terrantic', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Krishna Srinivasan', 'Developer of an end-to-end operational data platform designed to present information in real-time to deliver critical insights. The company''s platform employs an artificial intelligence-driven contextualization engine to transform existing data from multiple sources into actionable insights to help the food supply chain industry visualize operations, make swift decisions, and improve margins and returns while optimizing throughput, enabling food processors, growers, and packhouses to effectively manage their data and modernize their operations for a sustainable food future.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:41:56', '2026-03-08 16:41:56', '2026-03-08 16:41:56'),
