  ('zcrm_5797994000003811147', '37degrees', '37degrees', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Tilak Jain Ph.D', 'Manufacturer of portable culture incubators and live imaging modules intended to offer integrated tools for dynamic biological observation and experimentation. The company provides compact, battery-powered systems with cloud monitoring and onboard artificial intelligence and machine learning computing with real-time culture tracking and data sharing, enabling researchers and educators to deliver accessible, intelligent lab experiences to scientific and academic communities.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 20:58:14', '2026-03-10 20:58:14', NULL),
