  ('zcrm_5797994000003814300', 'CCN Health', 'CCN Health', 'Madhav Jami', 'Alex Wheeler', 'Developer of a workflow platform designed to provide remote patient monitoring programs. The company''s platform helps to automate workflows, generate billing and audit reports, and provide clinical vitals along with individual patient dashboards, enabling healthcare professionals to boost productivity.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:02:16', '2026-03-10 09:02:16', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814326', 'NerBio', 'NerBio', 'Madhav Jami', 'Vincent Titolo', 'Developer of patient monitoring application designed to improve patient health, safety, care, and treatment outcomes. The company''s application is based on a radical architectural redesign that leverages programmable microelectronics and smart internet-connected devices to monitor multiple intensive care patients, enabling medical professionals to increase staff efficiency and monitor patients remotely.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:06:45', '2026-03-10 09:06:45', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814352', 'Manus Robotics', 'Manus Robotics', 'Madhav Jami', 'Faye Wu', 'Developer of a smart health and wellness device designed to empower independent and healthy living. The company provides a wearable robot that not only provides intelligent daily living assistance to the disabled but also collects and analyzes patient muscle data for rehabilitation purposes, enabling people with disabilities to regain their quality of life and independence.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:12:02', '2026-03-10 09:12:02', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814378', 'Ixcela', 'Ixcela', 'Madhav Jami', 'Erika Angle', 'Operator of a biotech company intended to improve internal fitness. The company identifies key small molecules associated with gut microbiome imbalances and develops individualized therapy to restore these molecules to their proper levels with a personalized program that includes proprietary supplements, as well as personalized nutrition and fitness plans, enabling individuals to address common health issues such as irritable bowel syndrome, acid reflux, and leaky gut.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Connect', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:20:11', '2026-03-24 09:18:03', '2026-03-24 09:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814404', 'BraveHeart', 'BraveHeart', 'Madhav Jami', 'Stephen McCalmont', 'Developer of a chronic care monitoring platform intended to offer wearable sensors to track physiological patient data. The company''s platform offers a base station that provides pre-configured and secure access to third-party monitoring devices into one continuous data stream, reducing patient burden and improving patient compliance, enabling healthcare providers to collect relevant, clinical-quality, actionable data at lower costs.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:23:52', '2026-03-10 09:23:52', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814430', 'NimbleHeart', 'NimbleHeart', 'Madhav Jami', 'Sonal Tambe', 'Developer of a cardiac monitoring device designed to offer clinical-level cardiac monitoring for the elderly population in their homes. The company''s cardiac monitoring services include a clinical-grade mobile cardiac monitoring device that gives guidance in the pursuit of cardiovascular health goals, enabling doctors and patients to get both real-time and post-session analysis.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:36:32', '2026-03-10 09:36:32', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003814456', 'Certa Dose', 'Certa Dose', 'Madhav Jami', 'Caleb Hernandez', 'Developer of color-coded syringes designed to eliminate pediatric medication dosing errors. The company''s syringes help reduce and eliminate errors using a color confirmation system and visualization and provide certainty during emergencies and other life-altering situations, enabling parents, nurses, doctors, and paramedics to minimize critical dosing errors during treatment.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 09:38:55', '2026-03-10 09:38:55', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003816033', 'Hatchproof', 'Hatchproof', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Imran Syed', 'Hatchproof is Moneyball for companies. We turn the digital exhaust of work into real time performance intelligence. Who is performing, who is at risk, who to hire next.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Connect', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 10:05:23', '2026-03-09 15:53:05', '2026-03-09 15:53:05'),
