  ('zcrm_5797994000003817063', 'UmaHari', 'UmaHari', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Alok Adholeya', 'Provider of microbial applications intended to enhance yield, reduce investments, and consistent performance, and mitigate the continued vulnerability of commodities prices. The company offers affordable, eco-friendly, and sustainable alternatives to traditional chemistry to green and safe biochemistry, enabling farmers to deliver remarkable yield increases and return on investment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 11:31:10', '2026-03-12 05:28:05', '2026-03-12 05:28:05'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003817094', 'ImagoAI', 'ImagoAI', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Abhishek Goyal', 'Developer of on-site food testing systems intended for analytical assessment purposes. The company''s platform integrates hyperspectral imaging hardware with artificial intelligence models, performs non-destructive scanning without consumables, captures hundreds of spectral bands per pixel, analyzes chemical signatures using trained micro-models, delivers real-time results, supports testing for mycotoxins, vitamins, and particle size, enabling food and feed producers, laboratories, and processors to conduct rapid, repeatable, and cost-controlled quality and safety evaluations directly at the point of use.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 11:33:32', '2026-03-12 11:39:11', '2026-03-12 11:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003817125', 'Stock Cropper', 'Stock Cropper', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Zack Smith', 'Manufacturer of animal barns intended to facilitate either egg-laying or broiler poultry production. The company''s barns are powered by a solar panel on the roof which charges on board and powers the single-wheel front drive wheel system for either manual or autonomous moves, enabling farmers and clients engaged in animal husbandry to raise and breed their animals and birds in a more natural environment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 11:38:03', '2026-03-12 05:33:20', '2026-03-12 05:33:20'),
