  ('zcrm_5797994000003817562', 'ComplaintRX', 'ComplaintRX', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Adam Nadler', 'Developer of medical record software intended to manage the patient intake and resupply process while improving the accuracy and efficiency of medical record review. The company''s platform simplifies documentation review, reduces administrative workload, and provides AI-driven insights to help DME providers stay ahead of audits and regulatory shifts, enabling users to automate documentation reviews, ensure payer compliance, and minimize audit risks.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:50:00', '2026-03-10 18:50:00', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003817588', 'Spence', 'Spence', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Steven Locke', 'Developer of a cloud-based platform designed to enhance patient care and reduce healthcare costs. The company''s platform offers patient adherence and improves patient satisfaction by fast, simple, and accurate segmentation, determines their likelihood to adhere to a treatment plan, and provides visibility and guidance needed to support positive behavioral change in patients, ultimately delivering better care while lowering costs, enabling physicians to communicate with each patient to generate tailored interventions to improve their adherence.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:53:31', '2026-03-10 18:53:31', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003817614', 'Pearl Diagnostics', 'Pearl Diagnostics', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Kieran Marr', 'Developer of in vitro diagnostic tests designed to aid diagnosis and screening for bacterial and fungal lung infections. The company uses proprietary and patented technology to detect microbial vesicles that are released during infection and excreted into urine, and detect fungal lung infections using interferon-gamma release technologies, enabling clinicians to detect the microbial cause of pneumonia using patented technology.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Amelia Chapin', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-10 18:55:56', '2026-03-10 18:55:56', NULL),
