  ('zcrm_5797994000003824213', 'ImmuneBridge', 'ImmuneBridge', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Nina Horowitz', 'The company raised $7.7 million of seed funding in a deal led by NFX on March 24, 2026. M Ventures and other investors also participated in the round. The funds will be used to offer the company''s platform to outside partners biotech startups and pharmaceutical companies that want to develop allogeneic immune therapies without having to reinvent the manufacturing process to do it.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 11:53:58', '2026-03-24 11:53:58', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003824239', 'Persevere Therapeutics', 'Persevere Therapeutics', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Greg Bosch', 'Developer of oncology therapeutics designed to treat cancer through targeted molecular inhibition in pharmaceutical research. The company develops a small-molecule therapeutic candidate that inhibits the oncogenic transcription factors c-MYC and nuclear factor kappa B, disrupting cancer cell metabolism and limiting cellular proliferation and survival, enabling researchers and clinicians to study potential treatments aimed at improving clinical outcomes for cancer patients.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Zachary Christinat', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 12:12:25', '2026-03-24 12:12:25', NULL),
