  ('zcrm_5797994000003838077', 'Confido', 'Confido', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Justin Hunter', 'Provider of financial operations software intended for automated revenue and trade process management. The company''s platform offers automated cash application, classification and deductions tagging, trade promotion management, sales forecasting, ERP and retailer/distributor integrations, enabling consumer packaged goods (CPG) finance and operations teams to reduce manual work, improve visibility into trade spend and forecasting, and streamline core accounting workflows.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Markos Papakosmas', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-16 08:11:47', '2026-03-16 08:11:47', '2026-03-16 08:11:47'),
