  ('zcrm_5797994000003838263', 'SetSale', 'SetSale', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Assaf Weinberg', 'Developer of an HVAC sales platform designed to perfectly price, pitch, and close deals with tools to help sales teams improve their performance. The company''s platform provides tools for meeting preparation, deal analysis, and identifying, and leverages artificial intelligence to analyze sales data from various sources, including emails, calendars, and CRM systems, enabling contractors and supply chain participants to standardize quoting, reduce manual processes, maintain pricing accuracy, and improve coordination across sales, distribution, and downstream customer interactions.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-17 10:05:32', '2026-03-23 08:24:25', '2026-03-23 08:24:25'),
