  ('zcrm_5797994000003847646', 'Vibronix', 'Vibronix', 'Madhav Jami', 'Pu Wang', 'Developer of an advanced imaging technology designed to commercialize sensor devices for the diagnosis of diseases and treatments. The company''s intravascular facilitates surgical guidance and diagnosis that could help cardiologists to know the quantity and location of lipid buildup on the patient''s heart arterial wall, enabling doctors with surgical guidance for the treatment of heart disease.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 08:35:34', '2026-03-24 08:35:34', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003847672', 'Meacor', 'Meacor', 'Madhav Jami', 'Toufic Azar', 'Developer of a catheter-based medical device designed to repair the mitral and tricuspid valves. The company develops an anchoring catheter system used to treat heart disease with a special focus on transcatheter interventions, which have reduced risks and trauma associated with conventional surgery, enabling patients who are not surgical candidates to be effectively treated for mitral valve regurgitation.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 08:38:28', '2026-03-24 08:38:28', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003847698', 'Soundable Health', 'Soundable Health', 'Madhav Jami', 'Catherine Song', 'Developer of artificial intelligence sound technology designed to understand and manage health and diseases through digital audible biomarkers. The company creates novel measurement standards for areas of clinical practice through smartphones that have been traditionally hard to track, and audible biomarkers are captured, uncovering medical insights at patients'' convenience, enabling patients, providers, and researchers to advance care journeys and scientific research.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 08:45:45', '2026-03-24 08:45:45', NULL),
