  ('zcrm_5797994000003847822', 'fJscaler', 'fJscaler', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Michael Laber', 'Developer of semiconductor technologies designed to advance high-speed optical communication systems. The company''s platform incorporates DSP-based coherent optical technology, linear transimpedance amplifiers, Mach-Zehnder modulator drivers, direct detect optical systems, and digitally assisted transceivers with calibration and self-test features, enabling equipment manufacturers in the optical communications industry to achieve reliable interconnects, scalable bandwidth from 100G to 800G, and integration into next-generation data infrastructure.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-24 10:53:12', '2026-03-24 10:53:12', NULL),
